OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain windy and some showers
OL,7,Fcontinuing to affect Dumfries and
OL,8,FGalloway, further east staying mostly
OL,9,Fdry with some clear spells, feeling
OL,10,Fquite chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,13,Fthe day as any showers in the west
OL,14,Ffading out in the morning. Quite a
OL,15,Fpleasant afternoon with Autumn
OL,16,Fsunshine for most areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
