OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPatchy
OL,6,Frain Monday morning, becoming dry and
OL,7,Ffeeling a lot warmer but cloudy in
OL,8,Fwest. Mild Tuesday with some showers.
OL,9,FRain arriving overnight, clearing on
OL,10,FWednesday with bright spells later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
